    <!-- ═══ 10 · BEGINNING THE PROCESS ═══ -->
    <section id="process" class="bg-background">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-5xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight mb-6">Beginning the process</h2>
        <div class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch] mb-12">
          <p>The first step is a free 15-minute fit call. It is not a counselling session, but a short conversation about what is bringing you here, what you are looking for, and whether my way of working seems appropriate for what you need. If I think the issue falls outside my scope, or that another kind of professional support would serve you better, I will say so directly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-7 bg-card/30">
            <p class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-3">Step 1</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl mb-3">Free fit call</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed">A 15-minute conversation to discuss whether this approach fits and when an in-person appointment might be possible. There is no obligation to continue.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-7 bg-card/30">
            <p class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-3">Step 2</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl mb-3">Initial consultation</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed">A full 60-minute session at R850, with space to explore what is present, ask questions, and experience the work directly. There is no obligation to continue beyond this.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-primary/30 rounded-xl p-7 bg-primary/5">
            <p class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-3">Step 3</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl mb-3">Agree the next step</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed">The five-session process offers a contained starting point at R3,400. Ongoing counselling is also available where useful. The focus and rhythm are agreed together.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mt-14 pt-12 border-t border-border/60">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl text-foreground mb-6">A contained first piece of work</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mb-9 max-w-[65ch]">Over five sessions, the work moves from clarifying what is actually happening, to identifying what maintains it, to introducing adjustments and testing how they hold. Each session builds on the last. The process ends with a review of what has shifted and what, if anything, would be useful to continue.</p>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            {fiveSteps.map((step) => (
              <div class="flex gap-5 items-start border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-5">
                <span class="ctc-gold-text font-heading text-2xl shrink-0 w-8">{step.num}</span>
                <div><h4 class="font-heading text-xl mb-2">{step.title}</h4><p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed">{step.text}</p></div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-[65ch]">This is a structure for the work, not a promise of resolution in five sessions. Some people come for a focused period around a particular difficulty or transition; others find that a longer relationship becomes useful as different parts of their life begin to connect. There is no predetermined duration. <a href="/wisdom/what-happens-in-a-five-session-counselling-process/" class="ctc-inline-link">Read the fuller process overview.</a></p>
          <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mt-6 max-w-[65ch]">For teenage boys, the starting process includes a parent consultation before work with the young person begins. The <a href="/mentoring-for-adolescents/" class="ctc-inline-link">teenage mentoring page</a> explains that pathway and the boundaries around parent involvement.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 11 · FEES ═══ -->
    <section id="fees" class="ctc-warm-bg border-y border-border/40">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-10">Fees and practical arrangements</h2>
        <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 bg-background/70 mb-8">
          <dl class="font-body space-y-5">
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 items-baseline"><dt>15-minute fit call</dt><dd class="font-heading text-2xl">Free</dd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 items-baseline border-t border-border/60 pt-5"><dt>Individual session<span class="block text-sm text-foreground/75 mt-1">60 minutes &middot; in person or online</span></dt><dd class="font-heading text-2xl whitespace-nowrap">R850</dd></div>
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 items-baseline border-t border-border/60 pt-5"><dt>Five-session process<span class="block text-sm text-foreground/75 mt-1">Five 60-minute sessions</span></dt><dd class="font-heading text-2xl whitespace-nowrap">R3,400</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch]">
          <p>Sessions are usually weekly or fortnightly, depending on what is useful and practical. In-person appointments are available at selected times in Newlands; online sessions remain available by video call.</p>
          <p>The five-session rate supports continuity and commitment to the process. A limited number of reduced-rate spaces may be available where the standard fee is genuinely prohibitive. If cost is a real barrier, mention it when reaching out and it can be discussed privately.</p>
          <p class="text-base">Sessions are self-funded and are not submitted directly to medical aid. For parents of teenage boys, the separate parent consultation is R600 for 45 minutes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 12 · OTHER PATHWAYS ═══ -->
    <section class="bg-background">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-5xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-5">Other ways of working together</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch] mb-10">I work with adults generally, and have particular experience with boys and young men, and with people involved in contemplative practice. These pages describe those pathways in more depth.</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          {supportPaths.map((path) => (
            <a href={path.href} class="group flex flex-col border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-7 bg-card/30 hover:border-primary/60 transition-colors duration-200">
              <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">{path.title}</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed flex-1">{path.text}</p>
              <span class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-sm mt-5 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-primary/40">Read more &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 13 · SCOPE OF PRACTICE ═══ -->
    <section class="ctc-dark">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-24 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-gold-gradient text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-8">Scope of practice</h2>
        <div class="font-body text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch]">
          <p>This is supportive Wellness Counselling under ASCHP registration. It is distinct from clinical psychology, psychotherapy, psychiatry and medical treatment, and it does not include diagnosis of psychiatric conditions or the prescribing of medication.</p>
          <p>There are situations in which specialist psychological, psychiatric, addiction, crisis or medical care is more appropriate. Responsible counselling includes recognising those limits rather than trying to make every difficulty fit within one scope of practice. Where I believe another form or level of support would serve you better, I will discuss that openly and help you think through an appropriate next step.</p>
          <p>If you need urgent help, or are in immediate danger, please contact an emergency service rather than waiting for a counselling appointment.</p>
          <p class="text-base">Confidentiality, appropriate boundaries and respect for your autonomy are foundational to the process. <a href="/scope/" class="ctc-inline-link">Read the full scope and ethics.</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 14 · FAQ ═══ -->
    <section class="bg-background">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight mb-12">Questions before you begin</h2>
