        <div class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch] mb-9">
          <p>If something on this page feels familiar, you are welcome to begin with a free 15-minute call. We can speak about what is happening, what you are looking for, and whether working together feels like a good fit. There is no obligation to continue afterwards.</p>
          <p class="text-base">The calendar below is for that introductory call. In-person counselling appointments in Newlands are arranged afterwards, with the location details shared privately.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-4">
          <a href="#cal-inline-embed" class={primaryButton} data-cta="book-fit-call" data-service={SERVICE} data-placement="closing">Book a free 15-minute fit call</a>
